Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.62,0:07:21.00,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Mi brazo emite un sonido…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.76,0:07:24.80,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡El teléfono está llamando!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.80,0:07:27.58,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Pero no he marcado ningún número aún.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:31.68,JoJo-announcer,Josu,0,0,0,,¿Sí? Residencia Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:33.30,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Ha contestado!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:36.77,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Si capta los tonos de marcado,\Nel teléfono realizará la llamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:41.44,JoJo-main,Josu,0,0,0,,¡Oye! ¿Eres tú, Koichi?\N¡Soy yo, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.80,0:07:43.36,JoJo-announcer,Josu,0,0,0,,Koichi, ¿dónde estás?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:46.36,JoJo-announcer,Josu,0,0,0,,¿Qué es eso? ¿Escucho olas?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.30,0:07:50.26,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Koichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.74,0:07:54.62,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,tú también tienes un poder\Ncomo yo, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.06,0:07:59.96,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Bien! Estoy seguro\Nde que Josuke vendrá.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.96,0:08:02.05,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Necesitará de 15 a 20 minutos en coche.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:03.98,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Debo resistir hasta entonces!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:05.88,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡A toda costa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.45,0:08:10.57,JoJo-main,Josu,0,0,0,,El sonido del mar… Un teléfono público…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:13.83,JoJo-main,Josu,0,0,0,,Koichi debe estar…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.83,0:08:15.17,JoJo-main,Josu,0,0,0,,¡Por aquí!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:18.93,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:21.52,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.94,0:08:23.54,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Está volviendo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:25.52,JoJo-main,,0,0,0,,¡Tendré que pelear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.88,0:08:41.50,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Abre la puerta, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.77,0:08:44.65,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¿Por qué no intentas derribarla?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.65,0:08:48.55,JoJo-internal/narrator,Koi,0,0,0,,Si Josuke ve una puerta rota,\Nle parecerá extraño.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.75,0:08:56.44,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿Sabes qué? Me siento muy feliz.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.59,0:09:02.78,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Me alegra que tengas poderes\Nal igual que yo, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.27,0:09:06.68,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Aunque me molesta\Nque me los hayas ocultado.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:08.65,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Pero me alegra de todos modos.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:13.35,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Porque lo más importante de un hombre\Ny una mujer que viven juntos
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.35,0:09:17.50,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,es el amor y tener la misma\Nvalía o metas, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:20.79,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Compartimos algo que no tiene nadie más.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.79,0:09:24.31,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,No podríamos ser más compatibles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.72,0:09:27.35,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Así que, Koichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:28.78,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,abre la puerta.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.96,0:09:37.55,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Te he dicho que abras! ¡Ábrela ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:38.79,SFX4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)\pos(1060.999,537.333)}Te odio
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.27,0:09:47.77,sign_14022_135_I_hate_you,Sign,0,0,0,,Te odio
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:52.28,JoJo-main,Reve,0,0,0,,¡Te odio! ¡Te odio! ¡Te odio!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:52.35,SFX42,Sign,0,0,0,,¡Te odio!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.28,0:09:55.05,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡¿Que no podríamos\Nser más compatibles?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.05,0:09:58.08,JoJo-main,,0,0,0,,¡¿No comprendes que solo quiero irme?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:10:02.97,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Ese sonido no se detendrá hasta que\Nte disculpes llorando y me olvides.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.45,0:10:10.95,SFX42,Sign,0,0,0,,¡Te odio!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:10.88,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿Qué dices? Yo no escucho nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:13.76,JoJo-top,Reve,0,0,0,,Te odio…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.95,0:10:11.27,SFX43,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz23.21\move(1034.333,460,1127.666,486.666,4,296)}Te
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.95,0:10:11.83,SFX43,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\frz23.21\frx14\fry38\pos(1386.333,598.666)}odio
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.27,0:10:11.75,SFX43,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\frx344\fry54\frz7.377\move(1194.332,478.666,1223.666,539.999,17,101)}Te
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:13.56,SFX41 - Copy,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,600)\move(1341,545.332,1354.333,611.998,242,910)}¡Te odio!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:17.91,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Co-con ella
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.91,0:10:20.17,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,no podré repetir lo de Tamami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.17,0:10:22.34,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Sus delirios son demasiado fuertes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.34,0:10:25.77,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,No sabía que fuera tan testaruda…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.59,0:10:34.65,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Por fin he descubierto que nos une\Nel hilo rojo del destino.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:36.97,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Algunos jamás lo encuentran.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.47,0:10:39.79,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡¿No comprendes cuán maravilloso es?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:46.81,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Koichi…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:50.78,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Solo pensaba convertirte\Nen un hombre maravilloso,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.78,0:10:52.59,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,pero las cosas han cambiado.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.05,0:10:56.97,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,No dejaré que te vayas\Nhasta que te enamores de mí.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.97,0:10:59.64,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Haré que me ames!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.28,0:11:01.70,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,De lo contrario,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:04.95,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,me vería obligada a matarte.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.11,0:11:08.99,JoJo-internal/narrator,Koi,0,0,0,,No puedo dejar que entre…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.99,0:11:11.49,JoJo-internal/narrator,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Debo volver a atacarla con Echoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.49,0:11:14.83,JoJo-internal/narrator,Koi,0,0,0,,Si me esfuerzo,\Nconseguiré un sonido más fuerte.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:16.15,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Echoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.82,0:11:24.48,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Le ocurre algo extraño…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.74,0:11:25.91,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Echoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:28.75,JoJo-internal/narrator,Koi,0,0,0,,¡N-no se mueve!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.61,0:11:32.93,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¿Se ha muerto?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:36.46,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¿La desesperación mató a mi Stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:41.63,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Echoes se ha muerto!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:45.40,Eyecatch - Left,Signtop,0,0,0,,{\pos(1456,350)}E
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.40,0:11:45.52,Eyecatch - Left,Signtop,0,0,0,,{\pos(1456,350)}Ech
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:45.61,Eyecatch - Left,Signtop,0,0,0,,{\pos(1456,350)}Echo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.61,0:11:45.81,Eyecatch - Left,Signtop,0,0,0,,{\pos(1456,350)}Echoes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.81,0:11:45.90,Eyecatch - Left,Signtop,0,0,0,,{\pos(1456,350)}Echoes A
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.90,0:11:46.02,Eyecatch - Left,Signtop,0,0,0,,{\pos(1456,350)}Echoes AC
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.02,0:11:46.11,Eyecatch - Left,Signtop,0,0,0,,{\pos(1456,350)}Echoes ACT
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.11,0:11:48.03,Eyecatch - Left,Signtop,0,0,0,,{\pos(1456,350)}Echoes ACT1
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.61,0:11:46.73,Eyecatch - Left,Signbot,0,0,0,,{\pos(81,794)}Hiro
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.73,0:11:46.86,Eyecatch - Left,Signbot,0,0,0,,{\pos(81,794)}Hirose
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.73,0:11:48.03,Eyecatch - Stats,sign bot,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,0)\pos(48,31)}Poder: E \NVelocidad: E \NRango: B \NResistencia: B \NPrecisión: C \NPotencial de Desarrollo: A
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.86,0:11:46.98,Eyecatch - Left,Signbot,0,0,0,,{\pos(81,794)}Hirose Ko
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.98,0:11:48.03,Eyecatch - Left,Signbot,0,0,0,,{\pos(81,794)}Hirose Koichi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.17,0:11:51.98,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡N-no! M-mi…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.98,0:11:56.11,JoJo-main,Oi,0,0,0,,¡Mi Echoes no se mueve\Nen lo más mínimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.46,0:12:01.03,JoJo-main,Oi,0,0,0,,Los Stand se mueven\Ncon energía espiritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.03,0:12:06.34,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Debo haberlo forzado tanto\Nal alterarme, que lo he matado!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:10.54,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Mi Echoes…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:11.71,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡¿Qué?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:14.63,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿Qué es eso?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.63,0:12:16.00,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿Se llama "Stand"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:18.33,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿Qué es ese Stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.01,0:12:22.34,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡El zapatero estorba!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.34,0:12:24.22,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Me va a matar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.39,0:12:28.72,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Si entra y me atrapa,\Ntarde o temprano moriré!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:37.73,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Abre, Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.94,0:12:42.53,JoJo-internal/narrator,Koi,0,0,0,,¡No atravieses esa puerta!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.98,0:12:46.62,JoJo-internal/narrator,Koi,0,0,0,,Cuánto daría por que esa puerta\Npudiese apartarla de mí…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:51.58,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡No está! Es un cascarón vacío.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:52.87,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿Dónde lo has metido?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.59,0:12:56.44,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿Qué ha pasado con la cosa de dentro?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.97,0:13:01.74,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Pe…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:02.68,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Pero si…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.97,0:13:04.69,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¿Qué ha pasado?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.69,0:13:08.18,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Mi Echoes no había muerto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:11.96,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¿Ha cambiado de forma al \Nabandonar su antiguo caparazón?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.96,0:13:13.06,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿Qué le ha pasado?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.32,0:13:17.19,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Su forma ha cambiado y ha encogido.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.19,0:13:20.11,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Si solo cambió de apariencia, da igual.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.75,0:13:22.11,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Qué veloz!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.77,0:13:28.35,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿Qu-qué? ¿Y este viento?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:31.29,sign_19394_209_Bam,Sfx,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,586)}Bam
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:33.17,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Salió volando!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.17,0:13:36.42,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡No sé cómo, pero fue como\Nsi la expulsara una ráfaga!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:43.17,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿Qué ha sido eso?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.85,0:13:45.29,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿Qué ha pasado?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.59,0:13:49.88,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Lo que Echoes escribió sobre la puerta…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.69,0:13:51.31,SFXBlue,AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA,0,0,0,,Fiush
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.00,0:13:53.14,sign_19950_216_Fwoosh,Sfx,0,0,0,,Fiush
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.85,0:13:58.48,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,La palabra de esa puerta\Nse hizo realidad cuando la toqué.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:14:02.51,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Ese sonido de ventisca\Nhizo que saliera volando de verdad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:13:59.75,SFXBlue,AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)}Fiush
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.51,0:14:00.13,SFXBlueGreen,AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)}Fuum
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.13,0:14:01.87,SFXEchoes,AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\frz354.8\move(1126.904,298.857,1162.904,350.857,929,1304)}Fuum
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.51,0:14:06.50,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Antes deseé que la puerta\Npudiera apartarla de mí…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:09.58,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Lo controlé sin siquiera saberlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.41,0:14:12.22,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Es mi nuevo Echoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.65,0:14:14.61,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Echoes Act 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.90,0:14:19.29,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Koichi…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.63,0:14:25.63,sign_20684_225_Teioh,Sign,0,0,0,,Teioh
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:25.63,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Son ellos…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:31.91,JoJo-main,Josu,0,0,0,,Si buscamos casas deshabitadas\Ncerca del mar, este es el lugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:36.14,JoJo-main,Oku,0,0,0,,Pero hay un montón de casas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:37.85,JoJo-main,Oku,0,0,0,,No sabemos en cuál está.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.85,0:14:41.77,JoJo-main,Josu,0,0,0,,Encontremos el teléfono público.\NKoichi usó uno para llamarnos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.57,0:14:47.26,JoJo-main,Josu,0,0,0,,Tras encontrar el teléfono,\Nregistraremos las casas cercanas a él.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.26,0:14:48.25,JoJo-main,Oku,0,0,0,,Bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.22,0:14:54.37,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,El tierno de Koichi\Nme pertenece solo a mí.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.27,0:14:57.93,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,No lo compartiré con nadie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:08.97,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,No deberías acercarte más, Yukako.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.11,0:15:13.29,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Ahora tengo más que claro
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:17.10,JoJo-main,,0,0,0,,que no podrás superar\Nlos poderes de mi Echoes Act 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.87,0:15:20.30,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,No podrás mantenerme cautivo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.08,0:15:26.55,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Mi párpado izquierdo\Nha comenzado a estremecerse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.55,0:15:30.70,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Me sucede desde pequeña\Ncuando me altero
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.31,0:15:34.08,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,y comienzo a ponerme agresiva.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.51,0:15:39.16,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,No te pongas chulo solo por obtener\Nun poder ligeramente diferente.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.16,0:15:41.50,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Me pondré agresiva!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.55,0:15:41.89,SFXSizzle1,SFX,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Chsss
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.79,0:15:43.11,SFXSizzle2,SFX,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Chsss
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.29,0:15:45.16,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Quema!
Dialogue: 2,0:15:42.89,0:15:43.16,SFXSizzle1,SFX,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}Chsss
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.16,0:15:46.84,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡¿Co-cómo te atreves?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:50.22,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Me he quemado la mano! ¡Maldito mocoso!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.22,0:15:52.64,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Cuando dijiste que te pondrías agresiva,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.64,0:15:55.10,JoJo-main,,0,0,0,,¿te referías a tu manera de hablar?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.59,0:15:59.16,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿Cómo has podido hacerme esto?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.16,0:16:00.73,JoJo-main,,0,0,0,,¡No eres más que un polluelo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.99,0:16:03.21,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Me perteneces!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:05.23,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡¿Me desafías a pesar de ello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.87,0:16:07.99,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡¿Aunque me perteneces?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.99,0:16:09.99,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Echoes Act 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:12.36,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¿Fallé?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.83,0:16:17.75,JoJo-main,Oku,0,0,0,,¡Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.04,JoJo-main,Josu,0,0,0,,¡Lo escuché!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:21.25,JoJo-main,,0,0,0,,Sonó como una demolición.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.61,0:16:23.93,JoJo-main,Oku,0,0,0,,Oye, ¿no será esa casa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.94,0:16:28.17,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,No puedo creer que su pelo\Npueda crecer tanto…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.17,0:16:30.26,JoJo-main,,0,0,0,,Su espíritu debe ser enorme.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.51,0:16:33.26,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Su espíritu es negro y rencoroso…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.65,0:16:36.63,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿El tuyo se llama Echoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.63,0:16:39.89,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Ahora que sé lo que hace,\Nno tiene nada de especial.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.47,0:16:43.17,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Solo debo evitar tocar\Nsus palabras, ¿no?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.17,0:16:45.11,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Te lo preguntaré una vez más…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.53,0:16:48.36,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Te gusto, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.88,0:16:54.84,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,A ver si te atreves\Na decir que no te gusto.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.31,0:16:59.12,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Te haré pedazos junto con la casa\Nen ese mismo instante.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.59,0:17:03.24,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Si mueres, serás mío para siempre,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.68,0:17:07.54,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,porque tu recuerdo vivirá\Nen mi corazón por toda la eternidad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:11.05,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Contesta de una vez!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:15.68,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Si estoy pasando por esto es porque\Nnunca escuchas lo que te digo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.35,0:17:18.89,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Te he estado diciendo que no me gustas
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.38,0:17:21.16,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,todo este tiempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:25.02,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Te mataré, Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.45,0:17:28.97,SFXBlue3,AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA,0,0,0,,{\frx38\fry322\frz285.4\pos(866.333,334.667)\clip(m 797 534 l 761 469 740 406 737 354 761 316 548 254 674 676)}¡Kabum!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.59,0:17:30.67,sign_25166_282_Dogon,Sfx,0,0,0,,Kabum
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:36.30,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Y también te dije\Nque no podrás atraparme.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.95,0:17:39.58,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Tocaste las palabras\Nque te harán salir disparada.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.99,0:17:43.37,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Las palabras que tanto despreciaste\Nrodean mi cuerpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.32,0:17:58.55,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Su pelo se ha vuelto blanco.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:03.06,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,No estará muerta, ¿o sí?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.43,0:18:07.81,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Está viva!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:11.93,JoJo-internal/narrator,Koi,0,0,0,,Por muy loca y terrible que haya sido,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.93,0:18:14.51,JoJo-internal/narrator,Koi,0,0,0,,¿debería alegrarme este resultado?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.89,0:18:22.63,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Aunque no pueda atacarte a ti,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.63,0:18:26.13,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡me percaté de que\Nsolo debo destruir tu Stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.46,0:18:28.99,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Maldito mocoso!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.99,0:18:30.46,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Imbécil!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.85,0:18:36.81,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Y pensar que aún puede atacar…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.81,0:18:38.59,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Su espíritu es gigantesco!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.59,0:18:40.97,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Cállate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:45.10,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡¿Cómo te atreves, enano meón?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:48.80,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡¿Cómo te has atrevido a hacerme esto?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:53.69,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Mi precioso pelo se ha tornado blanco,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.69,0:18:56.11,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,maldito incontinente!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:18:59.95,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Me gustabas!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:03.45,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Pero no te perdonaré lo que le\N has hecho a mi precioso pelo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:07.61,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Seas quien seas! ¡No perdonaré\Nque estropees mi belleza!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.62,0:19:15.31,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Le arrancaré el pene a esta cosa\Njunto con todos sus órganos!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.31,0:19:16.71,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,De-detente…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:17.92,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Silencio!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.69,0:19:22.09,JoJo-main,,0,0,0,,¡Te sucederá lo mismo, ¿no?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.40,0:19:27.06,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿Qué? ¿Qué ha sido ese crujido?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.57,0:19:31.59,JoJo-main,Kkoi,0,0,0,,Suelta a Echoes y sujétate a algo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.59,0:19:33.07,JoJo-main,,0,0,0,,El peñasco se va a caer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.78,0:19:39.37,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Cuando Echoes oyó tus latidos,\Ntambién oyó que la tierra estaba cediendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:43.53,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡No creas que tu mentiras\Nte salvarán el pellejo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.51,0:19:55.88,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Debo soltar esta cosa\Ny sujetarme a algo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.88,0:19:59.80,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡Maldición! ¡No tengo tiempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:05.43,SFXPink,AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA,0,0,0,,{\move(944.429,1001.714,965,17.714,30,280)}Boing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.43,0:20:06.25,SFXPink,AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA,0,0,0,,{\pos(1146.124,17.714)}Boing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.23,0:20:06.97,SFXPink2,AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,1)\frz310.7\pos(899.429,666.286)}Boing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.97,0:20:07.79,SFXPink2B,AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,1)\frz314.2\pos(776.001,542.857)}Boing-Boing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.88,0:20:16.23,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Te lo advertí, ¿no?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.23,0:20:20.97,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,Pero nunca escuchas\Nlo que te digo, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.59,0:20:27.38,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿Ya lo habías escrito?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:32.22,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿Mientras intentaba destrozar a Echoes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.68,0:20:36.17,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,escribiste eso en la roca\Nbajo el acantilado?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:40.50,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Mientras intentaba matarlo,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.08,0:20:45.26,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¿él buscaba una manera de salvarme?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.77,0:20:49.36,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,M-me ha derrotado por completo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.19,0:20:56.53,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,No, perdí desde el primer\Nmomento en que lo vi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.98,0:21:02.64,JoJo-main,Oku,0,0,0,,¡Oye, Koichi! ¿Estás bien?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.64,0:21:04.24,JoJo-main,Josu,0,0,0,,¡¿Todo bien, Koichi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.89,0:21:06.99,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Josuke! ¡Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.99,0:21:11.00,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Tardasteis muchísimo! ¡Joer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.29,0:21:15.26,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,Pero ahora me gusta mucho más.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.27,0:21:20.22,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,No me importa\Nque me ignore por completo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.01,0:21:23.43,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,El simple hecho de pensar en ti
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.01,0:21:25.27,JoJo-main,Yuka,0,0,0,,¡me hace feliz!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.27,0:21:28.57,JoJo-main,Oku,0,0,0,,Oye, mira. ¿No es Yukako?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.57,0:21:30.52,JoJo-main,Oku,0,0,0,,¡Su pelo está blanco!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:32.02,JoJo-main,Josu,0,0,0,,Vaya, es cierto.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.33,0:21:37.02,JoJo-main,Oku,0,0,0,,¿No te parece que sonríe\Ncomo si no pudiera ser más feliz?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:38.72,JoJo-main,Oku,0,0,0,,Y mira en esta dirección.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.44,0:21:42.03,JoJo-main,Josu,0,0,0,,Tienes razón. Me da escalofríos.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.76,0:21:43.95,JoJo-main,Oku,0,0,0,,¡Salgamos de aquí!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.95,0:21:45.76,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,¡Sálvame, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.76,0:21:47.53,JoJo-main,Josu,0,0,0,,¡No dependas de mí!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:52.67,JoJo-main,Guy,0,0,0,,¿No te ha parecido\Nde lo más extraño, Masaji?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.67,0:21:55.82,JoJo-main,Masa,0,0,0,,No estoy borracho, abuelo…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.56,0:22:11.05,sign_31733_325_Morioh_City_Land,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs48}2do hito de Morioh\N{\fs72}Cabo Boing\N{\fs48}Cómo llegar: Si le preguntas a algún pescador\Ndónde queda el Cabo Boing,\Nte llevarán en bote con mucho gusto.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.50,0:22:00.06,JoJo-top,Nar,0,0,0,,El Cabo Boing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.06,0:22:02.19,JoJo-top,Nar,0,0,0,,Se hizo famoso gracias al rumor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.19,0:22:05.97,JoJo-top,Nar,0,0,0,,de que unos pescadores vieron\Na una chica intentando suicidarse,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.97,0:22:10.23,JoJo-top,Nar,0,0,0,,pero rebotó contra una roca\Ny volvió a tierra firme con un "boing".
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.31,0:22:14.31,JoJo-main,Teach,0,0,0,,Hirose.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.62,0:22:17.02,JoJo-main,Teach,0,0,0,,Estudiaste mucho para este examen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.02,0:22:19.48,JoJo-main,Teach,0,0,0,,Parece que puedes cuando te lo propones.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.81,0:22:19.54,sign_32077_359_English_Exam____,Sign,0,0,0,,Examen de Inglés
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.81,0:22:19.54,sign_32077_360_Test_3________Ko,Sign,0,0,0,,Tercer examen        Koichi Hirose
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.18,0:22:21.44,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,No sé
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.06,0:22:24.64,JoJo-main,Koi,0,0,0,,cómo sentirme al respecto.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.94,0:22:52.31,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.31,0:22:54.57,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.57,0:22:57.36,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.36,0:22:59.03,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.03,0:23:01.41,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.41,0:23:03.78,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.78,0:23:06.58,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.58,0:23:08.29,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.29,0:23:10.54,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.54,0:23:12.88,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:14.50,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.50,0:23:17.13,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.13,0:23:21.63,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.63,0:23:25.18,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.18,0:23:30.64,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.64,0:23:34.02,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
